 there ever be a beach episode?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5799136/screencap/604b8dd507941.jpg"},{"title":"Titanic with Senpai","synopsis":"The girls are enjoying themselves at the beach when calamity strikes. Is this the end of the Kameido tennis club?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5812473/screencap/604b8e8a388a7.jpg"},{"title":"The Super-Scary Super-Strange Files! Scariest Movie Ever with Senpai","synopsis":"After a day at the beach, the girls head to an inn to spend the night. However, there is a foreboding air about the shadow looking in...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5821126/screencap/604b8f48b15c1.jpg"},{"title":"Night at the Museum with Senpai","synopsis":"The girls are bored at school when Nasuno announces that she bought an art museum. They immediately head there to check out the art, but the objects on display aren't what they were expecting.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5830737/screencap/604b8fc70f70d.jpg"},{"title":"Oblivion with Senpai","synopsis":"The girls decide to have some fun playing an online RPG. Will their party amass a wealth of equipment and experience points or end in tragedy?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5841824/screencap/604b903ee2f37.jpg"},{"title":"Face/Off with Senpai","synopsis":"Yuri wakes up one morning to discover she's inside Marimo's body. But when she gets to school, she finds another version of herself inside her own body. Who is who? Who is the real Yuri?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5843766/screencap/604b90ce89ea0.jpg"},{"title":"Once Upon a Time in America with Senpai","synopsis":"It's Kanae's first year of high school. Discover the exciting adventure that led her and Nasuno to join the tennis club.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5862607/screencap/604b914f52f21.jpg"},{"title":"Once Upon a Time in China with Senpai","synopsis":"The upperclassmen's flashback continues. With Kanae and Nasuno already on the team, next to join them is...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5871885/screencap/604b91c63719d.jpg"},{"title":"Enemy of the State with Senpai","synopsis":"It's the day of the Kameido High Marathon and the tennis club is raring to go. When Kanae and Marimo show up with strangely muscular bodies, it's only the beginning of a typically atypical race.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5871888/screencap/604b924983939.jpg"},{"title":"Saturday Night Fever with Senpai","synopsis":"The girls discover their tennis net is ripped, but all the club's funds have been spent on sandbags. With no other choice, they decide to work for a day at a fried chicken restaurant, where they run into a shockingly unfamiliar face.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/5871890/screencap/604b92c7ad622.jpg"}],"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
